{
  "name": "DR — 01 Content Calendar Publisher",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Scheduled publisher\n\nPulls due posts from the CRM, writes a caption per platform with Claude, runs the Florida compliance gate, then publishes to Facebook, Instagram and Google Business Profile.\n\n**Fails closed.** If the compliance endpoint is unreachable or returns anything other than `pass`, nothing publishes and the team is emailed.\n\nRequired env vars are listed in `automation/n8n/.env.example`.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "note-overview",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -140
      ]
    },
