      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Instagram\n\nPublishing is always two calls: create a media container, then publish it by `creation_id`. The container is not ready immediately, so the workflow waits and checks `status_code` before publishing.\n\n`image_url` must be a **publicly reachable HTTPS JPEG** — Instagram fetches it server-side. A signed URL that expires, or anything behind auth, fails here.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "note-instagram",
      "name": "Instagram notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
