      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Google Business Profile\n\nLocal posts still live on the v4 API (`mybusiness.googleapis.com/v4/.../localPosts`) — the newer split APIs do not cover them.\n\nAccess tokens last an hour, so the workflow exchanges the stored refresh token on every run rather than caching one.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "note-google",
      "name": "Google notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2520,
        780
